00:11:48.752 --> 00:11:55.080
So, the notes-- so,
this is an instruction

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.858
I've told the-- the AI to do.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:02.852
Basically, I'm just
telling it, you know,

00:12:02.892 --> 00:12:04.245
"Take notes while you're going.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:05.607
Just take notes."

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:08.670
You know, it's like a log,
an audit log.

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:11.640
It keeps track of the
errors it runs into.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:16.740
It keeps track of the solutions
it comes up with, and this is

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:19.530
really important for context.

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:26.550
So, you know, the AI
will eventually run out of

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:32.700
space in its context window,
and we need to be able to

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.680
refresh that reliably.

00:12:34.772 --> 00:12:37.650
The compressions, you know,
there's different ways

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:38.460
