00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:41.730
Don't work, you know,
completely well.

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.380
It always forgets
something important.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:47.040
So, that's the main reason,
but there's also a lot of side

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:48.780
benefits you get from notes.

