How will you avoid coding
and rely on AI in that case?"

00:42:23.030 --> 00:42:23.550
[JON GREEN] Yeah.

00:42:23.700 --> 00:42:26.010
So that's a great question.

00:42:26.130 --> 00:42:31.785
So that's where the iteration in
the spec becomes very important.

00:42:32.280 --> 00:42:35.229
You know, have to, you put all
those business requirements

00:42:35.229 --> 00:42:36.344
