00:42:36.900 --> 00:42:40.481
You know,
you work with it as it develops.

00:42:40.560 --> 00:42:42.660
So you develop,
you're developing the spec,

00:42:42.660 --> 00:42:43.710
you're developing the code.

00:42:44.275 --> 00:42:45.420
It's collaborative.

00:42:45.840 --> 00:42:48.456
If it's making, you know,
a webpage that doesn't,

00:42:49.380 --> 00:42:52.380
