00:43:04.110 --> 00:43:08.000
So it's not hands off.

00:43:08.490 --> 00:43:11.852
It's still hands on,
it's just different level.

00:43:12.270 --> 00:43:13.391
You know, you're looking,

00:43:14.943 --> 00:43:16.675
you know, making sure that
it's building the

00:43:16.675 --> 00:43:19.654
thing that we want,
that the user wants

00:43:20.460 --> 00:43:23.612
less than making sure
every line of code is,

00:43:23.660 --> 00:43:25.114
you know, exactly perfect.

