of databases that you have to

00:45:41.910 --> 00:45:43.500
incorporate into an application.

00:45:44.070 --> 00:45:48.104
Do you write those specs in
the spec in how it should

00:45:48.144 --> 00:45:49.244
interact with the database?

00:45:49.247 --> 00:45:52.604
Or do you have to use
something like a MCP to let

00:45:52.624 --> 00:45:54.739
it know what tools to use?

00:45:55.170 --> 00:45:56.490
