"I want something like this.

00:46:37.410 --> 00:46:39.269
What would that look like?"

00:46:39.930 --> 00:46:42.180
And, you know,
it depends on what

00:46:42.180 --> 00:46:42.840
you're building.

00:46:42.840 --> 00:46:45.060
If it's a system
that's in place,

00:46:45.060 --> 00:46:47.029
of course you need
it to be specific.

00:46:47.370 --> 00:46:50.430
But if you're creating something
new, maybe you see what the

00:46:50.430 --> 00:46:55.890
AI comes up with first, and
then refine it or, you know,

00:46:55.890 --> 00:46:58.797
correct it or, you know, yeah.

00:46:58.813 --> 00:46:59.333
Good.

